# TomTom Traffic API key — enables LIVE measured speeds for the main roads
# (Flow Segment Data). Free key: developer.tomtom.com (no credit card).
# Local dev: copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value.
# Bolt: set VITE_TOMTOM_KEY in the Bolt project settings / environment
# variables, then redeploy. NEVER commit a real key to this repo.
VITE_TOMTOM_KEY=
